  "kind": "marker passive with no PassiveEffects entry; behaviour lives in shop/purchase code and in the Hidden Power abilities",
  "summary": "Passive.UNOWN has no PassiveEffects entry and no combat effect of its own. The only code that tests the passive itself is the buy command: after a player buys a unit whose passive is UNOWN while the player is in an Unown shop (Transcendence effect active, or shopsSinceLastUnownShop is 0), has a free roll left, and every shop slot holds an Unown or is empty, the shop is reassigned and one free roll is spent; otherwise the bought slot is just emptied. The rest of Unown behaviour (the HIDDEN_POWER_* casts, reminiscences, Unown shops, prices) is keyed on membership of the Unowns list, not on this passive.",
  "triggers": [
   "OnBuyPokemonCommand after purchase: pokemon.passive === Passive.UNOWN",
   "Shop.assignShop (Unown shop decision) is keyed on Psychic synergy level / unownReminiscences, not on the passive",
   "HiddenPowerStrategy.process keyed on isIn(Unowns, pokemon.name)"
  ],
  "effects": [
   {
    "kind": "shop",
    "declaredRaw": "free roll on Unown shop; shop reassigned after buying an Unown",
    "scaling": "none (no AP, no crit)",
    "resolution": "game-commands buy branch calls assignShop(player, true, state) then shopFreeRolls -= 1",
    "evidence": [
