   }
  ],
  "conditions": [
   "Buy branch requires: (player has EffectEnum.TRANSCENDENCE OR shopsSinceLastUnownShop === 0) AND shopFreeRolls > 0 AND every shop slot is in Unowns or is Pkm.DEFAULT.",
   "assignShop(manualRefresh=true) makes an Unown shop only when hasTranscendence and shopsSinceLastUnownShop === UNOWN_PSY7_NB_SHOPS_INTERVAL (10); automatic refreshes (not locked) make one whenever hasTranscendence (Psychic level >= tier index 2 threshold, plus unownReminiscences on automatic refresh). An Unown shop gives +1 free roll and resets shopsSinceLastUnownShop to 0.",
   "The Unown pool depends on stage: stageLevel < 10 UnownsStage1, < 20 UnownsStage2, else UnownsStage3; the 6 shop slots are filled without repetition within the shop.",
   "On cast, the Hidden Power strategy increments player.unownReminiscences and deletes the board unit (player units that are not isSpawn), then kills the entity. Reminiscences are consumed (added to the Psychic level) by the next automatic assignShop and are zeroed when a locked shop is refilled.",
   "At the stage-end refresh, if the shop still contains only Unowns the player loses one free roll before the new shop is assigned.",
   "Buy and sell price of an Unown are the fixed BuyPrices.UNOWN / SellPrices.UNOWN constants (values not read in this record)."
  ],
  "resetBehaviour": "No state on the unit. Player fields shopsSinceLastUnownShop and unownReminiscences are player state; they are reset by assignShop (interval counter on Unown shop, reminiscences consumed on automatic refresh) and by refilling a locked shop (reminiscences zeroed).",
